Do not list web-discovery-project/.git/HEAD as an input of the WDP build action.
The sources come from a release tarball, so there is no .git directory and ninja
fails with "missing and no known rule to make it". The build itself does not use git
(fern builds with --version package and no versionDistance); package.json stays as
the rebuild trigger.

diff --git a/brave/components/brave_extension/BUILD.gn b/brave/components/brave_extension/BUILD.gn
--- a/brave/components/brave_extension/BUILD.gn
+++ b/brave/components/brave_extension/BUILD.gn
@@ -36,7 +36,6 @@
     # TODO(petemill): Have WDP use webpack (or another way) to spit out
     # a depfile which automatically lists all the input files used to generate
     # the WDP build.
-    "//brave/vendor/web-discovery-project/.git/HEAD",
     "//brave/vendor/web-discovery-project/package.json",
   ]
 
